n":"trask"},"findings":[],"frozen_at":1792366604,"frozen_at_iso":"2026-10-18T23:36:44Z","frozen_sha":"d7c0cdb4fd1061cc2356de42a6c8e95742c60979","head_ref":"copilot/trask-covariant-inherited-methods","head_repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","head_repo_id":210933087,"input_mode":"direct","launch_run":{"actor_id":218610,"attempt":1,"id":39177232200},"loop_kind":"pr_description","metadata":{"body":"<!--\r\nCHANGELOG.md is generated from merged pull requests. Do not add an entry unless this PR introduces\r\na deprecation or breaking change.\r\n-->\r\n\r\nRelated to https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/issues/20103\r\n\r\nFix missing optional controller spans when JAX-RS dispatches an HTTP request to a method that narrows an inherited return type, including generic resource interfaces.\r\n\r\n```java\r\ninterface ItemsResource<T> {\r\n  @GET\r\n  @Path(\"/current\")\r\n  T get();\r\n}\r\n\r\n@Path(\"/items\")\r\npublic class ItemsResourceImpl implements ItemsResource<String> {\r\n  @Override\r\n  public String get() {\r\n    return \"item\";\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nWith `otel.instrumentation.common.controller-telemetry.enabled=true`, `GET /items/current` now produces an `ItemsResourceImpl.get` controller span. Jersey and RESTEasy already supply `http.route` through their framework-specific instrumentation; the regression is the missing controller span, not missing route metadata in those frameworks.\r\n\r\nThe fix covers interface and superclass declarations in JAX-RS 1/2/3 and JAX-WS. Methods with different parameter types remain separate, and compiler-generated bridge methods do not produce duplicate instrumentation.\r\n\r\nRelated to #20103.","title":"Support covariant inherited instrumentation methods"},"mode":"publish","pr":20623,"pr_author_id":198982749,"protocol":"git-candidate-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1792366606,"generation":2,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"0f560bd4124849f78f50b04115c51e3a","profile":"git-candidate-v1","required_checks":[]},"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","repo_id":210933087,"request_id":"9787c20d461b4aafafe9e31b954905f2","schema":2,"source_private":false,"target_private":false,"workflow_ref":"review-loop-revisions/b2b33228386d04bca36862ab6f0b7e51afc1bfd7","workflow_revision":"b2b33228386d04bca36862ab6f0b7e51afc1bfd7"},"run":{"attempt":1,"conclusion":"success","id":39177274333,"url":"https://github.com/trask/copilot-workflows/actions/runs/39177274333"},"schema":2,"seen_findings":[],"seen_inline_findings":[],"seen_missed_findings":[],"stage":"verify_pending"}